WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.847
Week 36: Integrated Field Capstone. manage an unfamiliar situation brief and persuade reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan

2
00:00:08.847 --> 00:00:17.460
Form and meaning. Integrated control of all course structures with accuracy prioritized according to communicative impact.

3
00:00:17.460 --> 00:00:54.598
Model set. Permítame aclarar lo que entendí. Antes de actuar, debemos comprobar la fuente. Puedo resumir las dos posturas y justificar mi recomendación. Me adapto al registro sin imitar un acento. Mi plan de mantenimiento combina lectura, escucha, conversación y escritura. Allow me to clarify what I understood. Before acting, we must verify the source. I can summarize both positions and justify my recommendation. I adapt to the register without imitating an accent. My maintenance plan combines reading, listening, conversation, and writing.

4
00:00:54.598 --> 00:01:04.728
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:01:04.728 --> 00:01:18.570
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: manage an unfamiliar situation; brief and persuade; reflect on strengths and a maintenance plan. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:56.647
Model language. Permítame aclarar lo que entendí. — Allow me to clarify what I understood. Antes de actuar, debemos comprobar la fuente. — Before acting, we must verify the source. Puedo resumir las dos posturas y justificar mi recomendación. — I can summarize both positions and justify my recommendation. Me adapto al registro sin imitar un acento. — I adapt to the register without imitating an accent. Mi plan de mantenimiento combina lectura, escucha, conversación y escritura. — My maintenance plan combines reading, listening, conversation, and writing.

7
00:01:56.647 --> 00:02:06.395
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
